00:29:47.760 --> 00:29:51.060
But, what do we do
when things go wrong?

00:29:51.060 --> 00:29:53.327
Not internally,
that would be SRE.

00:29:53.327 --> 00:29:55.910
But if you're a customer, what
are the kind of things that you

00:29:55.910 --> 00:29:58.490
can do to prepare for any
mistakes that could happen

00:29:58.490 --> 00:29:59.282
in your production?

00:29:59.282 --> 00:30:01.490
MARK MANDEL: I like that
